WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:02.035
Harry: From calorie
count to portion sizes,

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:03.470
we wanted to find out all the differences

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:05.772
between Jollibee in the UK and the US.

00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:07.307
This is "Food Wars."

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:13.913
In the UK, Jollibee serves
their famous Chickenjoy

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:14.981
in six portion sizes,

00:00:14.981 --> 00:00:18.084
starting with a one-piece.

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:19.619
In the US, you can get your Chickenjoy

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:21.821
in five different portions.

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:25.125
A one-piece with a side.

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:26.793
Harry: Next up, we've got a two-piece.

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:29.929
Joe: A two-piece, also with a side.

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:30.930
Harry: We move to a three-piece.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.932
Joe: A three-piece that comes with a side.

00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:34.567
I'm so excited to try this.

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:36.936
It's my first-ever taste
of Jollibee fried chicken.

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:37.937
[crunching]

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:39.472
Not my first time, Harry.

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:42.575
Oh, that's good. That's really good.

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:43.910
I don't know how it stayed so crispy.

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:46.379
The next sizes up are buckets of chicken.

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:48.481
You can get a bucket in six

00:00:50.784 --> 00:00:52.752
or bucket of 10.

00:00:52.752 --> 00:00:55.021
Buckets from a UK Jollibee
come in three sizes,

00:00:55.021 --> 00:00:56.322
starting with a six-piece.

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:01.194
Then from there, we move up
to an eight-piece bucket.

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:05.165
And last but by no means least,

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:07.767
our biggest portion
size is a bucket of 12.

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:13.606
Should've got a bigger plate.

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:14.941
I'm gonna eat some more.

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:16.276
It's really good.

00:01:17.277 --> 00:01:20.580
[slow romantic saxophone music]

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.948
I just love chicken,

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:23.383
and this is a good example of it.

00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:25.452
[crunching]
[romantic music]

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:33.226
These little crispy bits
that fall off your chicken,

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:34.394
gold dust.

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:38.231
Let's each weigh our six-piece buckets

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:39.666
to see if the Chickenjoy in one country

00:01:39.666 --> 00:01:40.700
is bigger than the other.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.368
It's time for some Jenga.

00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:44.304
One.

00:01:44.304 --> 00:01:45.438
Joe: Ah!

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:46.072
Harry: Two.

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:49.275
Joe: We have over 100 grams more chicken!

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:50.810
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:52.946
I realize this is so arbitrary.

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:55.281
The size of the meats,

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:56.683
the amount of coating,

00:01:56.683 --> 00:01:59.452
but it's nice to win regardless.

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:00.520
[laughs]

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:01.588
The chicken at Jollibee

00:02:01.588 --> 00:02:02.956
also comes in the form of tenders.

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:05.058
In the UK, these are served
in four portion sizes.

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:07.794
As a single tender.

00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:09.462
What? One piece?

00:02:09.462 --> 00:02:10.296
One piece?

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:12.165
Who's getting one chicken tender?

00:02:12.165 --> 00:02:13.867
As two tenders.

00:02:15.502 --> 00:02:17.504
There's a portion of three tenders,

00:02:19.506 --> 00:02:22.575
and, finally, as a portion of four.

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:25.345
One chicken tender?

00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:27.080
I've never heard of that, anywhere.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.149
Well, here in America,

00:02:29.149 --> 00:02:31.651
we have normal portion sizes
for our chicken tenders.

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:35.088
You can get them in three
pieces, six pieces –

00:02:35.088 --> 00:02:37.857
I think three is not enough, but OK.

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:39.526
Three pieces,

00:02:39.526 --> 00:02:41.928
six pieces,

00:02:41.928 --> 00:02:43.563
10 pieces.

00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:44.797
Whoa!

00:02:49.335 --> 00:02:51.404
Or 16.

00:02:52.305 --> 00:02:53.206
♪ Yeah! ♪

00:02:54.607 --> 00:02:55.575
Tenders.

00:02:55.575 --> 00:02:56.543
How do you like that?

00:02:57.944 --> 00:02:59.412
Yeah, there's a little
bit more going on there.

00:02:59.412 --> 00:03:00.547
I like it.

00:03:00.547 --> 00:03:01.281
Little bit of heat to it.

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:03.116
The batter seems different.

00:03:03.116 --> 00:03:04.817
It has more of, like, the
buttermilk flavor to it,

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:07.220
of, like, the coating. Yeah.

00:03:07.554 --> 00:03:09.756
Garlic mayo, always.

00:03:09.756 --> 00:03:11.524
Who needs ranch when you have garlic mayo?

00:03:11.524 --> 00:03:13.359
Who needs garlic mayo when you have ranch?

00:03:13.359 --> 00:03:15.328
[bell ringing]

00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:18.498
Ranch is far superior to
garlic mayo, no question.

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:22.669
Hell, yeah. Love ranch.

00:03:23.069 --> 00:03:24.103
A worthy addition.

00:03:24.237 --> 00:03:26.239
Ranch is way better. Herbs and spices?

00:03:26.606 --> 00:03:27.941
Aren't they, like,
basically the same thing?

00:03:32.412 --> 00:03:33.980
Then we're on to some
Jollibee specialities.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.515
Now, one iconic dish is this one.

00:03:36.115 --> 00:03:37.317
This is the Jolly spaghetti.

00:03:37.483 --> 00:03:40.053
Now, this is a dish made of
spaghetti with some cheese,

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:41.988
as well as a sweet-style sauce,

00:03:41.988 --> 00:03:43.690
which is, I think, made
with, like, banana ketchup

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:44.824
and some meats as well,

00:03:44.824 --> 00:03:46.192
and then it's topped with hot-dog slices.

00:03:46.192 --> 00:03:48.261
In the UK, this only
comes as one portion size.

00:03:48.461 --> 00:03:49.996
That's a cute size you got there, Harry,

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:51.898
but here in the US, we have three sizes.

00:03:51.898 --> 00:03:53.800
Our regular portion,

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.902
our family portion,

00:03:55.902 --> 00:03:57.737
and the party portion.

00:03:57.737 --> 00:03:58.871
Look at this.

00:03:58.871 --> 00:04:00.940
This is supposed to be eight to 10 people.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:03.109
It's like a lasagna. Look at that.

00:04:03.142 --> 00:04:04.711
Now, according to a friend
of mine from the Philippines,

00:04:04.711 --> 00:04:06.145
the pro move is to dunk the chicken

00:04:06.145 --> 00:04:07.714
into the spaghetti sauce.

00:04:07.714 --> 00:04:08.715
So let's give that a try.

00:04:09.616 --> 00:04:12.885
The cold cheese isn't doing
it any favors, I'll be honest.

00:04:13.286 --> 00:04:15.455
[crunching]

00:04:15.455 --> 00:04:16.289
OK.

00:04:16.289 --> 00:04:17.690
Joe: Yeah.
Harry: It's actually not bad.

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:19.058
Joe: It's a bit misleading,
because their spaghetti

00:04:19.058 --> 00:04:20.860
is actually, the sauce is sweet.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:21.761
Very good.

00:04:21.761 --> 00:04:23.263
Yeah, together, that's really good.

00:04:23.296 --> 00:04:24.330
Then we're on to the burgers.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.266
Now, Jollibee is famous
for its Yumburgers,

00:04:26.266 --> 00:04:29.302
which is a beef burger with
its signature burger sauce.

00:04:29.302 --> 00:04:31.871
In the UK, these come as
either a single or as a double.

00:04:31.871 --> 00:04:34.240
Over here in the US, you can
get the classic Yumburger,

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:37.143
or this, the double Yumburger.

00:04:40.913 --> 00:04:42.682
Don't want a bun for your burger, you say?

00:04:42.682 --> 00:04:43.816
Jollibee has you covered.

00:04:43.816 --> 00:04:45.518
They have something
called the burger steaks,

00:04:45.518 --> 00:04:48.655
patties of burgers smothered
in their mushroom gravy.

00:04:48.655 --> 00:04:52.392
You can get them in two
patties, three patties,

00:04:52.392 --> 00:04:54.727
or the six-patty family pack.

00:04:54.727 --> 00:04:57.363
Over here, the burger steaks
only come as a two-piece.

00:04:57.430 --> 00:05:00.133
In the US, you can get
a side of white rice.

00:05:00.133 --> 00:05:03.569
We only have one size, and
it's this one right here.

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:05.638
Same here. Our rice just
comes in one portion,

00:05:05.638 --> 00:05:07.173
and it's wrapped up like this, very cute.

00:05:07.507 --> 00:05:10.310
Largest thing on a US
Jollibee menu is this,

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:13.846
the Chickenjoy Bucket Treat D.

00:05:13.846 --> 00:05:17.317
As in daaaamn!

00:05:17.317 --> 00:05:18.451
I want to eat this all.

00:05:18.584 --> 00:05:20.820
10 pieces of chicken, five sides,

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:22.722
and five of the peach mango pies.

00:05:22.722 --> 00:05:26.092
All of this for a reasonable price of $30.

00:05:26.459 --> 00:05:28.695
This is the biggest thing
on a UK Jollibee menu.

00:05:28.695 --> 00:05:30.263
It's a 12-piece family feast,

00:05:30.263 --> 00:05:31.064
and with one of these,

00:05:31.064 --> 00:05:33.099
you get a 12-piece bucket of Chickenjoy,

00:05:33.099 --> 00:05:35.835
two sides of fries, two chicken burgers,

00:05:35.835 --> 00:05:38.204
four chicken tenders, six dips,

00:05:38.204 --> 00:05:41.474
and a 1.5-liter bottle of
a soda of your choosing.

00:05:44.444 --> 00:05:45.745
I just want to start
this section by giving

00:05:45.745 --> 00:05:47.180
a shout-out to Jollibee.

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:48.815
Their nutritional information for the UK

00:05:48.815 --> 00:05:50.750
wasn't publicly available
when we were looking,

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:51.818
but we asked them to share it with us,

00:05:51.818 --> 00:05:52.685
and they actually did.

00:05:52.685 --> 00:05:54.253
So gold star for you guys.

00:05:54.253 --> 00:05:55.488
Everyone else, take note.

00:05:55.588 --> 00:05:58.024
The information is publicly
available in the US,

00:05:58.024 --> 00:06:00.193
so no special request needed over here.

00:06:00.226 --> 00:06:02.628
We now know that an average
three-piece from a UK Jollibee,

00:06:02.628 --> 00:06:05.198
assuming they give you a
drum, a thigh, and a breast,

00:06:05.198 --> 00:06:07.467
would come to 1,059 calories.

00:06:07.467 --> 00:06:09.235
I'd be lying if I said
this was good for you.

00:06:09.235 --> 00:06:10.870
The calories themselves aren't too bad.

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:12.638
However, there's just over 100%

00:06:12.638 --> 00:06:14.273
of your daily sodium allowance in here,

00:06:14.273 --> 00:06:16.542
as well as around 80% of your daily fat.

00:06:16.542 --> 00:06:19.312
A drum, thigh, and
breast from a US Jollibee

00:06:19.312 --> 00:06:21.447
comes to 920 calories.

00:06:21.447 --> 00:06:24.317
So our Chickenjoy actually
has fewer calories

00:06:24.317 --> 00:06:25.618
than the UK equivalent,

00:06:25.618 --> 00:06:28.054
as well as less than
half the sodium content.

00:06:28.054 --> 00:06:29.455
In both countries, there
are some differences

00:06:29.455 --> 00:06:30.456
in the nutritional stats

00:06:30.456 --> 00:06:31.924
between the different cuts of chicken.

00:06:31.924 --> 00:06:34.761
For example, a Chickenjoy thigh
is the most calorific cut,

00:06:34.761 --> 00:06:37.096
whereas a Chickenjoy breast
is the highest in sodium.

00:06:37.096 --> 00:06:39.065
If you're looking to cut back on calories,

00:06:39.065 --> 00:06:41.768
ask them to only give you drums.

00:06:41.768 --> 00:06:45.271
Three drums in the US
are around 660 calories.

00:06:45.271 --> 00:06:47.039
Three thighs, on the other hand,

00:06:47.039 --> 00:06:50.610
will set you back 1,140 calories,

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:52.578
a 72% increase.

00:06:52.578 --> 00:06:54.113
It's a similar deal in the UK.

00:06:54.113 --> 00:06:57.283
Three drumsticks would
come to 777 calories,

00:06:57.283 --> 00:07:00.453
whereas three thighs would come to 1,299.

00:07:00.453 --> 00:07:02.321
That's a 67% increase.

00:07:02.321 --> 00:07:04.490
OK, what about the most calorific thing

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:05.391
on the entire menu?

00:07:05.391 --> 00:07:07.794
That'd be this, the spaghetti party pack.

00:07:07.794 --> 00:07:11.063
One of these contains 5,000 calories

00:07:11.063 --> 00:07:14.033
as well as 10,000 milligrams of sodium.

00:07:14.033 --> 00:07:17.270
So therefore it is the
most sodium-rific thing

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:19.906
in the history of "Food
Wars." Congratulations.

00:07:20.006 --> 00:07:24.977
This is designed to feed
eight to 10 people, yes.

00:07:24.977 --> 00:07:26.245
But if there's anyone out there

00:07:26.245 --> 00:07:29.048
who is eating one of these on their own,

00:07:29.048 --> 00:07:30.183
listen to me.

00:07:30.183 --> 00:07:31.284
You gotta stop.

00:07:31.451 --> 00:07:32.985
Over in the UK, the highest calorie rating

00:07:32.985 --> 00:07:34.821
would obviously be the 12-piece bucket.

00:07:34.821 --> 00:07:36.456
Now, depending on the
cuts of chicken you get,

00:07:36.456 --> 00:07:37.924
the calories in here
could range anywhere from

00:07:37.924 --> 00:07:41.294
3,060 to 5,196.

00:07:41.294 --> 00:07:42.628
Even if they maxed out the calories

00:07:42.628 --> 00:07:43.796
and gave you all thighs in here,

00:07:43.796 --> 00:07:45.431
it would still somehow contain less sodium

00:07:45.431 --> 00:07:46.866
than the spaghetti party pack.

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:52.438
Unfortunately, Jollibee in the UK

00:07:52.438 --> 00:07:54.106
does not disclose its ingredients.

00:07:54.106 --> 00:07:56.409
The only thing we were able
to find was an allergen chart.

00:07:56.409 --> 00:07:57.343
It's pretty comprehensive,

00:07:57.343 --> 00:07:58.878
but there's nothing too shocking in there.

00:07:58.878 --> 00:08:00.146
The only thing that might
surprise you is that

00:08:00.146 --> 00:08:01.881
there's lots of celery and mustard use

00:08:01.881 --> 00:08:02.915
across the Jollibee menu.

00:08:03.182 --> 00:08:04.183
Same in the US.

00:08:04.183 --> 00:08:07.253
The only ingredients info we
could find on the US website

00:08:07.253 --> 00:08:09.822
is that the mangoes in
the peach mango pies

00:08:09.822 --> 00:08:12.492
are made from real Philippine mangoes.

00:08:12.492 --> 00:08:14.260
These mangoes are incredibly sweet.

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:16.395
They're actually in the
Guinness Book of World Records

00:08:16.395 --> 00:08:17.296
for said sweetness.

00:08:17.296 --> 00:08:18.698
Plus, I, Joe Avella,

00:08:18.698 --> 00:08:21.767
give them the award for
fast-food dessert excellence,

00:08:21.767 --> 00:08:23.703
because these pies are the best.

00:08:23.703 --> 00:08:24.804
I love them so much.

00:08:24.804 --> 00:08:26.372
[inhales]

00:08:26.372 --> 00:08:27.673
Ah, these things are so good.

00:08:27.773 --> 00:08:29.408
Looking over the US allergen list,

00:08:29.408 --> 00:08:32.178
it appears that the burgers at US Jollibee

00:08:32.178 --> 00:08:34.046
have fish allergens in them.

00:08:34.046 --> 00:08:35.281
Now, I don't know if that's something

00:08:35.281 --> 00:08:37.316
with the meat or the sauces,

00:08:37.316 --> 00:08:39.685
perhaps cross contamination
while being prepared,

00:08:39.685 --> 00:08:40.319
I have no idea.

00:08:44.423 --> 00:08:46.526
Here is everything you will
find on Jollibee's UK menu

00:08:46.526 --> 00:08:48.494
that you won't find in the US.

00:08:48.494 --> 00:08:50.296
And here's everything at a US Jollibee

00:08:50.296 --> 00:08:51.898
you cannot get in the UK.

00:08:51.898 --> 00:08:52.865
Let's start with some chicken.

00:08:52.865 --> 00:08:54.534
Now, in the UK, we have
an exclusive burger,

00:08:54.534 --> 00:08:56.602
which is the tropical chicken burger.

00:08:56.602 --> 00:08:59.405
It's a chicken burger which
is served on a brioche bun

00:08:59.405 --> 00:09:01.707
with cheese, lettuce,
Asian ginger chili sauce,

00:09:01.707 --> 00:09:03.242
and a ring of pineapple as well.

00:09:03.242 --> 00:09:04.644
Our next chicken option is this one,

00:09:04.644 --> 00:09:05.878
the Asian chicken rice bowl.

00:09:05.878 --> 00:09:07.914
It's a bowl with some
chopped-up chicken tenders,

00:09:07.914 --> 00:09:09.949
some rice, and an Asian-style slaw.

00:09:09.949 --> 00:09:11.150
For our chicken sandwiches,

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:13.185
we have the chicken sandwich deluxe.

00:09:13.519 --> 00:09:14.420
Generous with the mayo.

00:09:15.187 --> 00:09:16.556
Jollibee, your chicken sandwich

00:09:16.556 --> 00:09:21.394
is hovering around a McChicken level.

00:09:21.394 --> 00:09:22.228
Love the McChicken,

00:09:22.228 --> 00:09:24.730
but I wouldn't send the
McChicken into a war,

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:25.831
and certainly I would not send

00:09:25.831 --> 00:09:28.000
the Jollibee chicken sandwich deluxe.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.468
It's good. It's not fantastic.

00:09:29.602 --> 00:09:32.104
What I bet is awesome, though,

00:09:32.104 --> 00:09:33.773
is the spicy chicken sandwich.

00:09:33.773 --> 00:09:36.075
Yeah, look at that. They
got the sriracha on there,

00:09:36.075 --> 00:09:37.810
you see that in the bun?

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.879
Oh, and jalapeños, now? OK.

00:09:42.048 --> 00:09:44.083
This is actually very good.

00:09:44.083 --> 00:09:46.786
This might be, I might
send this guy into battle.

00:09:46.786 --> 00:09:49.422
[war cry]

00:09:49.689 --> 00:09:51.657
Moving away from the chicken
options, we have this,

00:09:51.657 --> 00:09:53.092
which is the Jolly hot dog.

00:09:53.459 --> 00:09:57.129
Exclusive burgers, we
have the big Yumburger

00:09:57.129 --> 00:09:59.732
and a personal favorite, the Aloha burger.

00:09:59.732 --> 00:10:01.133
It's got pineapple, you see that?

00:10:01.133 --> 00:10:04.670
And underneath there, bacon.

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:07.206
I love this burger. I gotta take a bite.

00:10:08.774 --> 00:10:11.143
A fantastic burger. Highly recommend it.

00:10:11.143 --> 00:10:12.979
Exclusive sides you can
only get at the US Jollibee

00:10:12.979 --> 00:10:15.081
include mashed potatoes.

00:10:15.081 --> 00:10:16.549
I don't care.

00:10:16.549 --> 00:10:19.418
And the adobo rice.

00:10:19.418 --> 00:10:20.820
This thing is a brick of rice.

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:21.921
They are generous with the rice.

00:10:21.921 --> 00:10:23.022
Man, it's packed in there.

00:10:23.389 --> 00:10:25.291
There's spices and a little
bit of, like, meat in here.

00:10:25.291 --> 00:10:26.292
That's good, yeah.

00:10:26.292 --> 00:10:27.126
This would be a good side.

00:10:27.126 --> 00:10:27.960
It's a good call on this side.

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:28.561
I like that a lot.

00:10:28.794 --> 00:10:31.163
Everyone's favorite segment, Sauce Talk.

00:10:31.297 --> 00:10:32.832
Man: Sauce Talk.

00:10:32.832 --> 00:10:34.567
We have four sauces that
you won't find in the US,

00:10:34.567 --> 00:10:35.801
and they are as follows:

00:10:35.801 --> 00:10:38.270
We have a Buffalo sauce; sriracha mayo,

00:10:38.270 --> 00:10:41.073
which in my opinion is one of,
if not the best, condiment.

00:10:41.073 --> 00:10:42.875
Then we have a sweet chili sauce,

00:10:42.875 --> 00:10:45.111
and, finally, we have an
Asian ginger chili sauce.

00:10:45.111 --> 00:10:47.446
Creamy sriracha, ranch,

00:10:47.446 --> 00:10:48.514
I'm very fascinated with this,

00:10:48.514 --> 00:10:49.849
a pineapple barbecue.

00:10:49.849 --> 00:10:52.418
I've never tried the Asian
ginger chili sauce before.

00:10:52.418 --> 00:10:53.619
Ooh, I like it.

00:10:54.553 --> 00:10:55.454
Yeah, that's good.

00:10:55.454 --> 00:10:56.989
Ooh, some heat.

00:10:56.989 --> 00:10:58.290
Whoo! Definitely hot.

00:10:58.290 --> 00:10:59.258
You can see, like, chili flakes

00:10:59.258 --> 00:11:00.526
kind of floating around in there,

00:11:00.526 --> 00:11:01.661
and that's not a red herring.

00:11:01.661 --> 00:11:03.596
Pineapple barbecue.

00:11:03.596 --> 00:11:05.598
Pine apple barbecue.

00:11:07.333 --> 00:11:08.934
That's fantastic barbecue sauce.

00:11:08.934 --> 00:11:10.803
This tastes a lot like

00:11:10.803 --> 00:11:13.839
a sweeter, creamier version of McDonald's

00:11:13.839 --> 00:11:15.608
standard barbecue sauce.

00:11:15.608 --> 00:11:17.877
If they sold this in retail,
I would absolutely buy it.

00:11:17.877 --> 00:11:20.112
That's very good. Wow!

00:11:20.112 --> 00:11:22.248
I love you, Jollibee. OK.

00:11:22.248 --> 00:11:23.783
Jollibee has a few
breakfast offerings in –

00:11:23.783 --> 00:11:24.383
[clears throat]

00:11:24.717 --> 00:11:26.252
Asian ginger chili sauce. Powerful.

00:11:26.252 --> 00:11:26.886
We're fine.

00:11:26.886 --> 00:11:28.821
Jollibee in the UK has a few
breakfast options on offer.

00:11:28.988 --> 00:11:31.223
We'll start at this end with
the breakfast burger steak.

00:11:31.223 --> 00:11:33.292
Next up, we've got the
breakfast Chickenjoy.

00:11:33.292 --> 00:11:35.027
Our third option is the breakfast hot dog,

00:11:35.027 --> 00:11:36.595
but instead of the chicken or the burger,

00:11:36.595 --> 00:11:38.197
you can just get a hot dog on the side.

00:11:38.197 --> 00:11:40.800
And the last breakfast option
is a breakfast Yumburger.

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:42.635
We have one exclusive
drink at a UK Jollibee,

00:11:42.635 --> 00:11:44.336
and it's this, the pineapple juice.

00:11:44.336 --> 00:11:45.438
The color on this is, like,

00:11:45.438 --> 00:11:47.606
darker than what I'm used
to for pineapple juice.

00:11:48.441 --> 00:11:50.309
Yep, it's pineapple juice. Like it.

00:11:50.309 --> 00:11:52.278
A US exclusive that I wanted
to share with you guys

00:11:52.278 --> 00:11:54.080
was the Jollibee breakfast,

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:55.681
but as you can see, I don't have it.

00:11:55.681 --> 00:11:57.383
According to the Jollibee I went to,

00:11:57.383 --> 00:11:59.251
about a month or two before filming this,

00:11:59.251 --> 00:12:01.654
Jollibee decided to start
phasing out the breakfast

00:12:01.654 --> 00:12:03.289
because no one was getting it.

00:12:03.289 --> 00:12:05.291
Now, I don't know if that's
just the ones in this area

00:12:05.291 --> 00:12:07.159
or nationally, but for the most part,

00:12:07.159 --> 00:12:10.029
I think Jollibee no
longer has breakfast, so,

00:12:10.029 --> 00:12:10.963
sorry, guys.

00:12:10.963 --> 00:12:12.998
And, finally, we have two
exclusive dessert options.

00:12:12.998 --> 00:12:15.034
Here we have the mango coconut sundae

00:12:15.034 --> 00:12:17.103
as well as a chocolate coconut sundae.

00:12:17.103 --> 00:12:18.537
The mango peach pies,

00:12:18.537 --> 00:12:20.673
I cannot believe you
can't get these in the UK.

00:12:20.673 --> 00:12:21.574
That is a crime.

00:12:21.574 --> 00:12:23.943
[crunching]

00:12:23.943 --> 00:12:26.045
This might be the best fast-food dessert.

00:12:26.045 --> 00:12:27.446
Yes, really.

00:12:27.446 --> 00:12:28.614
This is so great.

00:12:28.614 --> 00:12:32.184
[slow romantic music]

00:12:32.184 --> 00:12:33.452
Mm.

00:12:33.452 --> 00:12:35.421
See, like, I'm on my third
bite, and it's already gone.

00:12:35.421 --> 00:12:36.422
These pies are incredible.

00:12:36.422 --> 00:12:38.057
You have to have one of these pies.

00:12:39.191 --> 00:12:41.694
And this delicious, refreshing halo-halo.

00:12:43.796 --> 00:12:45.030
This is so refreshing.

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:46.866
Whatever they're doing,
they're doing it well.

00:12:46.866 --> 00:12:47.900
Would you like some?

00:12:49.201 --> 00:12:51.270
[crunching]

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:55.441
That's very good.

00:12:55.441 --> 00:12:56.842
Producer: This is really tasty.

00:12:56.842 --> 00:12:59.111
This blows KFC out of
the water for me, though.

